cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Deep Hedging in a Heston Market
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below.
authors:
  - name: hb84ffm
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/hb84ffm/deep-hedging-heston"
abstract: >-
  Deep hedging for a European call in a Heston market: deep feed-forward
  neural networks learn daily hedge positions in a stock and an idealized
  variance swap, minimizing the OCE representation of a CVaR loss on the
  terminal hedging error, following Buehler, Gonon, Teichmann and Wood
  (arXiv:1802.03042). The package ships with a pre-trained model, example
  notebooks and a pytest reference-value test suite.
keywords:
  - deep-learning
  - deep-hedging
  - heston
  - hedging
  - tensorflow
  - quantitative-finance
  - stochastic-differential-equations
  - optimization
